        "body": "## Summary\n\n- Restack on current `main` after #99720 merged.\n- Classify `policy/gateway-http-endpoint-enabled` as an automatic narrowing repair.\n- Wire `doctor --fix` to set the exact reported denied Gateway HTTP endpoint `enabled` paths to `false`.\n- Document that denied Gateway HTTP endpoints can be auto-disabled when `workspaceRepairs=true`.\n- Leave URL-fetch allowlist findings manual; this PR only disables denied endpoints and preserves nested endpoint config.\n\n## Real behavior proof\n\nBehavior or issue addressed:\n`doctor --fix` can now repair denied Gateway HTTP endpoint findings by disabling the reported endpoint paths while preserving nested endpoint options such as URL-fetch settings.\n\nReal environment tested:\nWSL Ubuntu source checkout at PR head `c216e7485c5e12df315a70543f092a6cce801b58`, rebased on current `main`. The proof used the real Policy doctor registration plus `runDoctorHealthRepairs` against an isolated temp workspace with `plugins.entries.policy.config.workspaceRepairs=true`; no live Gateway server, provider, or network call was started.\n\nExact steps or command run after this patch:\n1. Seed isolated `openclaw.jsonc` with `gateway.http.endpoints.chatCompletions.enabled=true`, `gateway.http.endpoints.responses.enabled=true`, nested URL-fetch options, and `workspaceRepairs=true`.\n2. Seed isolated `policy.jsonc` with `gateway.http.denyEndpoints=[\"chatCompletions\",\"responses\"]` and `gateway.http.requireUrlAllowlists=true`.\n3. Run source-entry repair proof: `node --import tsx .local/proof-99731.mts`, which calls `registerPolicyDoctorChecks` and `runDoctorHealthRepairs` for `policy/gateway-http-endpoint-enabled`.\n4. Run focused validation: `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/policy/src/doctor/register.test.ts extensions/policy/src/doctor/metadata.test.ts --reporter=dot`.\n5. Run docs/format/diff validation: `pnpm docs:map:check`; `pnpm exec oxfmt --check` for touched docs/policy files; `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD`; `git diff --check`.\n\nEvidence after fix:\n```text\nHEAD=local\nWORKSPACE=/tmp/policy-gateway-http-proof-icH0OS\nCHECKS_RUN=1\nCHECKS_REPAIRED=1\nCHECKS_VALIDATED=1\nBEFORE_FINDINGS=[{\"checkId\":\"policy/gateway-http-endpoint-enabled\",\"ocPath\":\"oc://openclaw.config/gateway/http/endpoints/chatCompletions/enabled\",\"requirement\":\"oc://policy.jsonc/gateway/http/denyEndpoints\"},{\"checkId\":\"policy/gateway-http-endpoint-enabled\",\"ocPath\":\"oc://openclaw.config/gateway/http/endpoints/responses/enabled\",\"requirement\":\"oc://policy.jsonc/gateway/http/denyEndpoints\"}]\nCHANGES=[\"Set gateway.http.endpoints.chatCompletions.enabled=false for policy conformance.\",\"Set gateway.http.endpoints.responses.enabled=false for policy conformance.\"]\nAFTER_ENDPOINTS={\"chatCompletions\":{\"enabled\":false,\"images\":{\"allowUrl\":true}},\"responses\":{\"enabled\":false,\"files\":{\"allowUrl\":true},\"images\":{\"allowUrl\":true,\"urlAllowlist\":[\"images.example.test\"]}}}\nREMAINING_FINDINGS=0\nREMAINING=[]\n```\n\nSupporting validation:\n```text\n[test] passed 1 Vitest shard in 9.88s\nTest Files: 2 passed\nTests: 299 passed\n\ndocs:map: docs/docs_map.md is up to date.\nAll matched files use the correct format.\ngit diff --check origin/main...HEAD passed.\ngit diff --check passed.\n```\n\nObserved result after fix:\nThe repair flow detected both denied Gateway HTTP endpoint findings, repaired both reported `enabled` leaves to `false`, validated with zero remaining endpoint findings, and preserved the nested URL-fetch options (`images.allowUrl`, `files.allowUrl`, and `images.urlAllowlist`) on the disabled endpoints.\n\nWhat was not tested:\nNo live Gateway HTTP server, live provider, network URL-fetch call, or LLM call was run. URL-fetch allowlist findings intentionally remain manual and are not auto-repaired by this PR.\n\n## Stack\n\n- Directly stacked on current `main` after #99720 merged.\n- Next downstream slice remains #99776 after this PR is ready.",
